---

pkg/zenui, pkg/bdf, pkg/zxpalette, and pkg/zenuiraylib originate from
github.com/ha1tch/zenimate (same author), likewise Apache 2.0 -- the
same cross-project sharing pattern zenimate's own THIRD-PARTY.md
already documents in the other direction (pkg/zxpalette there notes
its own origin as this project).

markdownmodal_gui.go is adapted from zenimate's own helpModal
(cmd/zenimate-gui/helpmodal.go, same author, likewise Apache 2.0),
generalised to take its title and content directly rather than a
single embedded help.txt.

pkg/fonts/sinclair.bdf is the ZX Spectrum 48K ROM's own character set;
see pkg/fonts/LICENSE-Sinclair.txt for the Amstrad/Cliff Lawson
permission it carries, the same basis rom/SINCLAIR.txt already
documents for the ROM images in rom/.

github.com/ha1tch/queryfy (same author) validates machines.json,
Apache 2.0.
